  "display_name": "Superior Ascendency of the Dominator: Control Duration/Recharge",
  "display_fullname": "Boosts Superior Attuned Superior Ascendency of the Dominator B Superior Attuned Superior Ascendency of the Dominator B",
  "display_help": "UNIQUE -- No more than 1 enhancement of this type may be slotted by a character.  Enhances the hold duration of a power by {Boost.Attrib.Hold.Scale}%, the hold duration by {Boost.Attrib.Stun.Scale}%, the immobilization duration by {Boost.Attrib.Immobilize.Scale}%, the sleep duration by {Boost.Attrib.Sleep.Scale}%, the fear duration by {Boost.Attrib.Terrorized.Scale}% and the confuse duration by {Boost.Attrib.Confused.Scale}% and reduces recharge time by {Boost.Attrib.Recharge.Scale}%.  This enhancement can only be slotted by Dominators and may be slotted into most control powers.",
  "display_short_help": "Enhances Control Duration and Recharge",
